## Draft handoff scope

Child of1575. Provisional receiving disposition; a fresh lead must finish
the four premise checks and full exit criteria before implementation.

Document package.source_url null rather than a fabricated download URL, acquisition/provenance evidence in existing manifest/README contracts, local exact-representation SHA256/size and unavailable archive checks separately. fetch.sh may accept caller-supplied files, verify/copy their exact bytes and fail clearly when acquisition is missing; no author contact or private redistribution authority. Preserve author files and public download route. Documentation only, no generic fetch helper or source-project edits.

## Validation boundary

Documentation/source verification and semantic/preservation checks, not numerical reruns or wording tests. No paid API model calls. Keep all existing scoring, signing and held author decisions unchanged.
